            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "설정 > 개인정보 보호 및 보안 > Bluetooth에서 Onyx Editor의 Bluetooth 사용을 허용하세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AMP (the unit's sound + the PC's)" : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AMP (the unit's sound + the PC's)"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "AMP (기기 사운드 + PC 사운드)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Amp captures and cabinets are stored over USB only: Bluetooth is too slow for them. Use the web editor with a USB cable to add, rename or delete them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Amp captures and cabinets are stored over USB only: Bluetooth is too slow for them. Use the web editor with a USB cable to add, rename or delete them."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "앰프 캡처와 캐비닛은 USB로만 저장할 수 있습니다. Bluetooth로는 너무 느립니다. 추가, 이름 변경, 삭제는 USB 케이블로 웹 에디터를 사용하세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Any channel works. If the pedal asks, leave it on channel 1." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Any channel works. If the pedal asks, leave it on channel 1."
