      }
    },
    "Program Change, Control Change and NRPN (which is a sequence of Control Changes). SysEx is NOT needed for mapping: a pedal only has to send Program Change and Control Change." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Program Change, Control Change and NRPN (which is a sequence of Control Changes). SysEx is NOT needed for mapping: a pedal only has to send Program Change and Control Change."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "프로그램 체인지, 컨트롤 체인지, NRPN(컨트롤 체인지의 연속)입니다. 매핑에 SysEx는 필요하지 않습니다. 페달은 프로그램 체인지와 컨트롤 체인지만 보내면 됩니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
