        }
      }
    },
    "The tuner is open on the unit" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The tuner is open on the unit"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "기기에서 튜너가 열려 있습니다"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The unit ignores the MIDI channel: a message on any of the 16 channels is accepted. Leave the pedal on its default channel." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The unit ignores the MIDI channel: a message on any of the 16 channels is accepted. Leave the pedal on its default channel."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "기기는 MIDI 채널을 무시합니다. 16개 채널 어느 것으로 보내도 받아들입니다. 페달은 기본 채널로 두세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The unit takes MIDI over USB and over Bluetooth LE (BLE-MIDI 1.0). Both paths use the same decoder, so every command works on either. BLE-MIDI service 03B80E5A-EDE8-4B33-A751-6CE34EC4C700, characteristic 7772E5DB-3868-4112-A1A9-F2669D106BF3 (notify + write without response)." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The unit takes MIDI over USB and over Bluetooth LE (BLE-MIDI 1.0). Both paths use the same decoder, so every command works on either. BLE-MIDI service 03B80E5A-EDE8-4B33-A751-6CE34EC4C700, characteristic 7772E5DB-3868-4112-A1A9-F2669D106BF3 (notify + write without response)."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "기기는 USB와 Bluetooth LE(BLE-MIDI 1.0)로 MIDI를 받습니다. 두 경로는 같은 디코더를 쓰므로 모든 명령이 어느 쪽에서든 동작합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The unit's general settings. The value is a raw number D, not a percentage." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The unit's general settings. The value is a raw number D, not a percentage."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "기기의 일반 설정입니다. 값은 백분율이 아닌 원시 숫자 D입니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The value is a raw number D, not a percentage: CC 6 = D alone when D < 128, else CC 6 = D >> 7 and CC 38 = D & 127 (BPM)." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The value is a raw number D, not a percentage: CC 6 = D alone when D < 128, else CC 6 = D >> 7 and CC 38 = D & 127 (BPM)."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "값은 백분율이 아닌 원시 숫자 D입니다. D가 128 미만이면 CC 6만 D로, 아니면 CC 6 = D >> 7, CC 38 = D & 127 (BPM)로 보냅니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
